{"chunk_id":"R1-2501644-001","collection":"ran1_tdoc_chunks","metadata":{"source":["Ericsson"],"tdocNumber":"R1-2501644","title":"LS on Rel-19 higher layers parameters list Post RAN1#120"},"point_id":"3237346610495617162"}
tion: RAN1 has endorsed a list of new higher layers parameters and/or updates on the existing higher-layer parameters for the following Rel-19 work items: NR MIMO Phase 5 (MIMO sheet) Evolution of NR duplex operation (SBFD sheet) Enhancements of network energy savings for NR (NES sheet) LP-WUS/WUR for NR (LP WUS/WUR sheet) NR XR Phase 3 (XR sheet) RAN1 would like to clarify the following regarding the list: For MIMO: The updates as compared to the previous LS R1-2410758 are highlighted in blue. RAN1 is still discussing some parameters in the list where the open issues are highlighted with square bracket, or marked as FFS, TBC/TBD, etc. In addition, RAN1 may see the need for additional higher layer parameters. RAN1 will continue working on consolidating them and will share the corresponding updates with other WGs in the next RAN1 meeting. RAN1 understands that RAN2 and RAN3 can modify the RAN1 higher layers parameter list for the purpose of proper implementation of the functionalities, when needed. RAN1 would like to inform RAN2 and RAN3 that the recommendations in R1-2305769 are used for preparation of the list of higher layers parameters. 2. Actions: To RAN WG2 and RAN WG3 ACTION: RAN1 respectfully asks RAN2 and RAN3 to consider the design of the corresponding higher-layer parameters in Rel-19. 3. Date of Next RAN WG1 Meetings: TSG RAN WG1 Meeting #120-bis 7th -11th April 2025 Wuhan, China TSG RAN WG1 Meeting #121 19th -23rd May 2025 St. Julian, Malta TSG RAN WG1 Meeting #122 25th -29th August 2025 Bangalore, India

