{"chunk_id":"R1-2002429-002","collection":"ran1_tdoc_chunks","metadata":{"source":["NTT DOCOMO"],"tdocNumber":"R1-2002429","title":"Summary on UE features for additional enhancements for NB-IoT"},"point_id":"17699809980513257496"}
The moderator recommends following email discussions for FL Proposals 1 and 2 (only if following condition is met). High priority items are recommended for discussion starting Monday, April 20th, 2020. Ideally, discussions on high priority items can be concluded by Friday, April 24, 2020. Medium priority items are recommended for discussion starting at the time that high priority items are (almost) converged before Monday, April 27th, 2020, otherwise starting at Monday, April 27th, 2020. Low priority items are recommended for discussion starting at Monday, April 27th, 2020 only if high and medium priority items are converged before Monday, April 27th, 2020. Otherwise, discussion on low priority items will be postponed to next RAN1 meeting. Note that high priority items other than in proposal 1 for additional enhancements for NB-IoT are jointly discussed with those for additional MTC enhancements. FL Proposal 1 (high priority): Email discussion/approval on feature group structure for additional enhancements for NB-IoT(20th-24th April) Confirm to keep FG2-1/3/6~16 FL Proposal 2 (low priority): Email discussion/approval on feature group details for additional enhancements for NB-IoT (TBD) Discuss whether or not 'with potential UE-specific cyclic shift for DMRS' in the bracket of FG2-3 name is removed Discuss whether or not multi-TB unicast in DL(UL) with non-interleaved transmission is a prerequisite for the support of multi-TB unicast in DL(UL) with interleaved transmission (FG2-6 and 2-8) Discuss whether or not to change 'optional without capability signalling' to ‘up to RAN2’ regarding ‘Mandatory/Optional’ column of FG2-14

